s=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/engaged-in-mission\">Blog - Engaged in Mission</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"/s/MNS-Bible-Bowl-2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">2025 MN Bible Bowl</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/lcms-national-convention-2023\">68th National Convention LCMS</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/2022-mns-district-convention\">2022 MNS District Convention</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/events\">District Events &amp; Calendar</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/classified-ads\">Classified Ads</a>\n\n<a class=\"Header-nav-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/2025-convention\">2025 Convention </a><a class=\"Header-nav-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/go-first-initiative\">Go First!</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-title\" data-controller=\"HeaderNavFolderTouch\" data-controllers-bound=\"HeaderNavFolderTouch\" href=\"/quick-links\">Quick Links</a>\n\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"/call-updates\">Call Updates</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"/2025-convention\" target=\"_blank\">2025 MNS District Convention</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"/s/Hospital-Pastoral-Contacts-082223.pdf\">Hospital Pastoral Contact List</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"https://www.lcms.org/set-apart-to-serve\" target=\"_blank\">Set Apart to Serve</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"https://www.lcms.org\">LCMS (Synod) Website</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"mnsdistrict.us9.list-manage.com\">Subscribe to eNews</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" data-test=\"template-nav\" href=\"/counseling\">Christian Counseling</a>\n<a class=\"Header-nav-folder-item\" href=\"/district-staff\">District Staff</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n<a class=\"Header-nav-item\" href=\"/donate\">Donate</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Locator tools</h1>\n\n <p id=\"back-to-top\"> </p> \n\n<h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>RESOURCES ON THIS PAGE</strong></h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Click on any link to take you to that portion of the page</p>\n\n \n\n<ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"#map-mns-district-office\">Map/Directions to the MN South District Office</a></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"#mns-churches\">MN South District Churches</a></p></li></ul><h3 data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></h3>\n\n \n\n<h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">map to the mn south district office</h3>\n\n <table><tbody><tr><td>←</td><td aria-label=\"Move left.\">Move left</td></tr><tr><td>→</td><td aria-label=\"Move right.\">Move right</td></tr><tr><td>↑</td><td aria-label=\"Move up.\">Move up</td></tr><tr><td>↓</td><td aria-label=\"Move down.\">Move down</td></tr><tr><td>+</td><td aria-label=\"Zoom in.\">Zoom in</td></tr><tr><td>-</td><td aria-label=\"Zoom out.\">Zoom out</td></tr><tr><td>Home</td><td aria-label=\"Jump left by 75%.\">Jump left by 75%</td></tr><tr><td>End</td><td aria-label=\"Jump right by 75%.\">Jump right by 75%</td></tr><tr><td>Page Up</td><td aria-label=\"Jump up by 75%.\">Jump up by 75%</td></tr><tr><td>Page Down</td><td aria-label=\"Jump down by 75%.\">Jump down by 75%</td></tr></tbody></table><img alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://maps.gstatic.com/mapfiles/api-3/images/spotlight-poi3.png\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 26px; height: 37px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\"/><img alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/vt?pb=!1m5!1m4!1i7!2i31!3i46!4i256!2m3!1e0!2sm!3i730487977!3m18!...\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\"/><img alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/vt?pb=!1m5!1m4!1i7!2i30!3i46!4i256!2m3!1e0!2sm!3i730487880!3m18!...\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\"/><img alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/vt?pb=!1m5!1m4!1i7!2i30!3i45!4i256!2m3!1e0!2sm!3i730487880!3m18!...\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\"/><img alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/vt?pb=!1m5!1m4!1i7!2i31!3i45!4i256!2m3!1e0!2sm!3i730487568!3m18!...\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\"/>To navigate, press the arrow keys.<img alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://maps.gstatic.com/mapfiles/transparent.png\" style=\"width: 26px; height: 37px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\" usemap=\"#gmimap0\"/><p class=\"gm-style-mot\"></p><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2018%...\" style=\"height: 18px; width: 18px;\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2018%...\" style=\"height: 18px; width: 18px;\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2018%...\" style=\"height: 18px; width: 18px;\"/><a aria-label=\"Open this area in Google Maps (opens a new window)\" href=\"maps.google.com\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: inline;\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Open this area in Google Maps (opens a new window)\"><img alt=\"Google\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20fill%3D%22none%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20view...\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 66px; height: 26px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"/></a><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20fill%3D%22none%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20view...\" style=\"height: 9px; vertical-align: -1px;\"/>Map DataMap data ©2025 GoogleMap data ©2025 Google50 km Click to toggle between metric and imperial units<a href=\"www.google.com\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" target=\"_blank\">Terms</a><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"www.google.com\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Report errors in the road map or imagery to Google\">Report a map error</a>\n\n\n<ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"#locator-tool\">LCMS Church, School, &amp; Worker Locator Tool</a></p></li></ul>\n\n<p id=\"map-mns-district-office\"> </p> \n\n<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>From Minneapolis</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Take 35W to Burnsville. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Take Exit 1, which is County Road 42. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Turn left (east) on County Road 42.  Continue through two stoplights until you pass under the 35E bridge and come to a third stoplight (exit ramp for 35E). </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Go to the very next street, which is <strong>Grand Avenue (</strong>frontage road for 35E<strong>);</strong> turn <strong>right</strong> then make an <strong>immediate left</strong> (you will see our brown brick building). </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Turn right into our upper lot; this is the main entrance.</p></li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>From St. Paul</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Take 35E south to Burnsville.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Take Exit 88B, which is County Road 42. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Turn left (east) onto County Road 42 and go under 35E.  You will come to a stoplight (exit ramp for 35E). </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Go to the very next street which is <strong>Grand Avenue </strong>(frontage road for 35E) and turn <strong>right</strong>; then make an <strong>immediate left</strong> (you will see our brown brick building). </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Turn right into our upper lot; this is the main entrance.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p>\n\n \n\n<a class=\"sqs-block-button-element--small sqs-button-element--tertiary sqs-block-button-element\" data-initialized=\"true\" href=\"#back-to-top\">\n    Back to top\n  </a>\n\n \n\n<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>From the South</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Take 35 north to 35E north to Burnsville.  </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Exit on County   Road 42. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Go east on County Road 42 (right) to the very next street, which is <strong>Grand Avenue South </strong>(frontage road for 35E).  </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Turn <strong>right</strong> onto Grand Avenue, and then an <strong>immediate left</strong> (you will see our brown brick building). </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Turn right into our upper lot; this is the main entrance.</p></li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>If you miss Grand Avenue </strong>you will come to Plymouth Avenue. Turn right onto Plymouth Avenue and then right again into the parking lot of Good Shepherd Lutheran Church and School.  Proceed <strong>slowly</strong> through the parking lot of Good Shepherd until you come to our brown brick office building and park in the upper lot. When school is in session (8:15 am – 3:00 pm), please use the instructions below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>When Good Shepherd School is in Session (8 am - 3 pm)</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">After turning on Plymouth Avenue, go past Good Shepherd’s parking lot. Continue on Plymouth Ave/145th Street, going around the back of Good Shepherd Lutheran School. Turn right on Grand Avenue South and right again after Havenwood Senior Living to enter our parking lot.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">To leave, you will need to go back the same way when the traffic cones are in place. Otherwise, you can proceed slowly through Good Shepherd’s parking lot.</p>\n\n <p id=\"mns-churches\"> </p><p id=\"locator-tool\"> </p>  \n\n<h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">map of all MN South District churches</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"/s/MNS-District-Congregation-Directory-1023.pdf\">List of congregations, sorted alphabetically by city </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"/s/Congregations-According-to-Circuit-Structure...\" target=\"\">List of congregations, sorted by circuit</a></p>\n\n\n\n<a class=\"sqs-block-button-element--small sqs-button-element--tertiary sqs-block-button-element\" data-initialized=\"true\" href=\"www.google.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n    Click here to view the map of all MN South churches\n  </a>\n\n \n\n<h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">LCMS church, school, &amp; worker locator tool</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The LCMS locator tool lets you search for any LCMS church, school, or worker across the entire Synod.</p>\n\n\n\n\n<a class=\"sqs-block-image-link\" href=\"https://locator.lcms.org/dashboard\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1745788529164_74\" target=\"_blank\">\n\n\n<img alt=\"LCMS locator image.PNG\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG\" data-image-dimensions=\"260x456\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" data-load=\"false\" data-loader=\"sqs\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG\" data-stretch=\"false\" decoding=\"async\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" height=\"456\" loading=\"lazy\" onload='this.classList.add(\"loaded\")' sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 33.33333333333333vw, 33.33333333333333vw\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKO...\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ00565M/LCMS+locator+image.PNG?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5122917ce4b08a7615958803/1595948912647-7QDN9DNENFKOJQ0056